[5.844108, "o", "\u001b[Hforwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream input.\u001b[K\r\n3. apply_history_action only sends\u001b[K\r\nupstream when action.forwarded_input is\u001b[K\r\nset; empty means nothing reaches tmux. The\u001b[K\r\noverlay is painted client-side via\u001b[K\r\nsurface.paint_overlays.\u001b[K\r\n4. This is a fast-client history overlay\u001b[K\r\nover bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-\u001b[K\r\nmode; the implementation notes stock tmux\u001b[K\r\nWheelUpPane would enter copy-mode, which\u001b[K\r\nis deliberately avoided.\u001b[K\r\nFocused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.\u001b[K\r\npy::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_imme\u001b[K\r\ndiately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts\u001b[K\r\nagent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b[K\r\nSuggested addition: assert\u001b[K\r\nagent_action.render_history is True,\u001b[K\r\nproving the overlay rendered rather than\u001b[K\r\nmerely dropping the event.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;70m\r\n✓ Read-only analysis complete · transcript 58f46732e1c4\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n› Captured once; sanitized transcript replay; no provider session persisted.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;70m\r\n[R]\u001b[30m[1][2] CC         \u001b[38;5;231m→ new session in railmux\u001b[30m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[25;1H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[5.844225, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
